WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.037
Now the other direction: from

2
00:00:02.037 --> 00:00:03.902
your language into English.

3
00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:06.086
Long sentences are the trap.

4
00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:08.527
Split long sentences into shorter

5
00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:10.854
ones. Keep your tenses steady.

6
00:00:10.854 --> 00:00:12.114
And use plain words,

7
00:00:12.114 --> 00:00:13.738
not literal idioms.

8
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:15.611
Read your English in your

9
00:00:15.611 --> 00:00:17.268
head. If it sounds odd,

10
00:00:17.268 --> 00:00:18.424
rewrite it.

11
00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:20.782
Check that subjects and verbs

12
00:00:20.782 --> 00:00:22.812
agree, and that your articles

13
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:23.923
are right.

14
00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:25.426
Your turn.

15
00:00:25.426 --> 00:00:26.591
What should you do with

16
00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:27.858
long sentences?
